    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d919">

                <pb facs="0950" n="830" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg830"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Meyer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-20"><hi rendition="#italic">October 20,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At request of Japanese Government you will, upon consent being given by Russia,
                    continue your friendly offices in behalf of Japanese Government and subjects
                    pending the reestablishment of the Japanese legation, and will instruct our
                    consuls to same effect by telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
